Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.42,0:04:04.01,Title,0,0,0,0,,《饥饿游戏3： 嘲笑鸟（下）》
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.42,0:56:47.57,Note,0,0,0,0,,（强制观看 所有施惠国国居民注意）
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.96,0:59:32.46,Note,0,0,0,0,,（克雷西达 都城）
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.84,0:59:33.38,Note,0,0,0,0,,（卡斯托 都城）
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.81,0:59:40.18,Note,0,0,0,0,,（波乐克斯 都城）
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.66,0:59:43.84,Note,0,0,0,0,,（梅萨拉 都城）
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.45,0:59:45.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（芬尼克·奥戴尔 4区）
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.73,0:59:51.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（皮塔·梅拉尔克 12区）
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.25,0:59:53.48,Note,0,0,0,0,,（凯特尼斯·艾佛丁 12区）
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.99,1:01:53.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（永远铭记嘲笑鸟）
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.22,1:18:59.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（通缉 盖尔·霍桑）
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.28,1:19:06.93,Note,0,0,0,0,,（通缉 皮塔·梅拉尔克）
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.89,1:26:10.68,Note,0,0,0,0,,（强制观看 所有施惠国国居民注意）
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.35,1:28:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,[手语]我们一定会再见面的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.79,0:00:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.83,0:00:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我知道 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I know, I know. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.46,0:00:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我知道我该轻点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's a little tender.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.05,0:00:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 现在试着发声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's try your voice now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.06,0:01:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫凯特尼斯·艾佛丁 我家在12区\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Katniss Everdeen. I'm from District 12.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.56,0:01:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我 - 没事 慢慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My… - Okay, take your time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.15,0:01:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的声带很肿胀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still got a lot of swelling in your vocal chords.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.86,0:01:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.62,0:01:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}name is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.54,0:01:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特尼斯·艾佛丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Katniss Everdeen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.67,0:01:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.63,0:01:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想跟他谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to talk to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.97,0:01:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.55,0:01:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 今天让他见个新面孔\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, um, we're trying somethin' new today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.10,0:01:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到那些医生时他情绪没什么变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been calmer with the doctors, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.60,0:01:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们对他来说是陌生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they're strangers to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.77,0:01:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 专家让他见几个家乡的熟人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're gonna test his response{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.82,0:01:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,来测试他的反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}on someone he remembers from home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.99,0:01:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会见到一个你信赖的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone he trusts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.25,0:02:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send her in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.97,0:02:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.47,0:02:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,普瑞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.18,0:02:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,身体好些了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you feelin'?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.93,0:02:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她走的太近了 - 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's too close. - Mmm, it's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.15,0:02:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是怎么到这里的 - 我们现在在13区\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How'd you get here? - We live in District 13 now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.52,0:02:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,13区是真实存在的 那些传言是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a real place. Stories are true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.28,0:02:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被救\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were rescued.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.24,0:02:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的家人没来看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My family hasn't come to see me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.58,0:02:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,12区遭到了轰炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was an attack on 12.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.45,0:02:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.17,0:02:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My family?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.92,0:02:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没能幸存下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bakery didn't survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.19,0:03:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为凯特尼斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Katniss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.65,0:03:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是因为她 - 那不是她的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's because of Katniss. - Wasn't because of her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.07,0:03:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她告诉你这么说的 - 她什么都没告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She tell you to say that? - She didn't tell me anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.61,0:03:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,普瑞姆 她是个骗子 那是个骗局\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a liar, Prim. It's a trick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.99,0:03:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮塔 你所说的是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peeta, what you're saying isn't real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.12,0:03:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她派你进来找我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She sent you here to talk to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.58,0:03:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她知道你现在在这 - 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She knows you're here now. - It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.04,0:03:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她全都知道 你不能相信她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She knows… You can't trust her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.09,0:03:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a monster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.63,0:03:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个混蛋 她是都城派来摧毁我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a mutt that The Capitol created to destroy us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.26,0:03:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把她带出来 - 你明白我说的话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get her outta there. - Do you understand me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.30,0:03:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要杀了她 普瑞姆 你一定要 杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to kill her, Prim! You have to kill her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.93,0:03:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凯特尼斯 - 她是个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Katniss? - She's a mutt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.89,0:03:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是受了药物的影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just a conditioned response.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.39,0:03:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杀了她 - 那不是真正的他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kill her! - It's not him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.23,0:03:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个怪物 是个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a monster! She's a mutt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.81,0:03:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 那不是他 - 她是个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, it's not him. - She's a mutt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.24,0:04:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,从4区来的人手不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not enough manpower coming in from 4.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.70,0:04:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个不成问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think that's a problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.33,0:04:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,请过来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.50,0:04:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们能离开一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you excuse us for just a moment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.17,0:04:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.26,0:04:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.43,0:04:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你身体有所好转\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you're feeling better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.98,0:04:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯诺要为他所犯下的罪行付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snow has to pay for what he's done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.44,0:04:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意全力跟你们合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna help the rebels in any way I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.52,0:04:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到皮塔那样真是难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hard to see Peeta this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.02,0:04:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not Peeta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.15,0:04:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,送我去都城区 我会尽我所能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send me to The Capitol. I'll do anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.91,0:04:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,对此我无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.66,0:04:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能把你送到那\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't send you there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.54,0:04:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们控制2区前我没法把你送到那\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't get into The Capitol until we control District 2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.54,0:04:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就送我去2区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then send me to 2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.84,0:05:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要我鼓舞士气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to fire up our troops?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.96,0:05:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,振奋军心 我到那边看看我能做些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call out to the loyalists? You've seen what I can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.51,0:05:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 你在那会很有用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.93,0:05:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我走之前 我去看望了皮塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw Peeta… before we left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.51,0:05:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有何想法？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what did you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.23,0:05:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,感到自己很自私\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something selfish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.23,0:06:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你再也不用嫉妒他了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you don't have to be jealous of him anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.98,0:06:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.53,0:06:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他好转之前我肯定毫无机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't stand a chance if he doesn't get better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.37,0:06:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定还是对他念念不忘\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll never let him go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.85,0:06:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在想什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's goin' on in your head?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.11,0:06:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.86,0:06:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就像你与一个醉汉接吻\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's like kissing someone who's drunk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.19,0:06:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那根本不是真正的吻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't count.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.54,0:06:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,30分钟后降落\N{\fnArial\fs30}30 minutes until touchdown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.66,0:06:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备降落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare for landing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.25,0:07:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,将它包上 最后一次机会 行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrap it up. Cut the chatter. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.42,0:07:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个装置就像一个捕鸟夹\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is another version of booby-trapping a resource.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.26,0:07:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 明白了 - 这部分装置使人致盲\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right, I see. - This one's designed to blind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.93,0:07:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,烟雾遮住眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smoke clings to the eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.18,0:07:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你抓蜂鸟一个道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an application of the hummingbird trap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.60,0:07:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们感到恐惧 开始跑向\N{\fnArial\fs30}You scare people so they flee in this direction{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.60,0:07:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个他们认为安全的方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}into what they think is a safe haven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.77,0:07:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这时引爆炸药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two-tiered explosion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.31,0:07:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,再过会 会有人冲上来帮助伤员\N{\fnArial\fs30}You allow people enough time to rush in, help the wounded, then…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.02,0:07:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这时再次引爆 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A second bomb. - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.61,0:07:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二枚炸弹安放在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second one goes off here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.90,0:07:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想在战场上 为了杀掉另一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess there are no rules anymore about{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.53,0:07:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们真是不择手段啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}what a person can do to another person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.24,0:07:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他们劫走皮塔时 可没有手下留情吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think Snow used any rulebook when he hijacked Peeta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.52,0:08:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到2区 我是赫姆斯下士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to District 2. I'm Corporal Homes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.89,0:08:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,请跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You follow me, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.40,0:08:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.78,0:08:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,政府军就是这么对我们说早安的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just how the loyalists say "Good morning."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.91,0:08:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,科因总统 感谢您派来的增援部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}President Coin, we're indebted to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.99,0:08:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时感谢嘲笑鸟对我们的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the reinforcements and the Mockingjay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.95,0:08:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们不确定2区以外的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not sure that anyone outside of 2{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.12,0:08:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是知道我们起义的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}knows what we've been up against.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.67,0:08:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是基地中心的立体图\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is The Nut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.08,0:08:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是都城的设在2区的总部 也是我们行动的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Capitol's headquarters for all offensive operations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.80,0:08:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,驻扎在里面的不仅有政府军\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's manned by both military{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.59,0:08:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有部分二区的平民\N{\fnArial\fs30}and civilian personnel from District 2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.72,0:08:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,从地图上看\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you can see, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.43,0:08:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个堡垒建在岩层深处 易守难攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}the fortress lies so far beneath the bedrock, it's untouchable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.18,0:08:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天我们试图突破东北门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday, we attempted to take the northeastern gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.23,0:08:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着遭到空中的进攻 不得不撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}The enemy countered from higher up and we were forced to pull back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.52,0:08:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,损失惨重\N{\fnArial\fs30}We took heavy losses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.06,0:08:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能策划一次佯攻 比如派部队聚集在其中一个门附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could we create a decoy? Send troops towards one gate, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.86,0:08:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后猛攻另一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}launch a staggered attack on another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.07,0:08:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 指挥官你要把哪支部队当做诱饵派上前线呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose troops do you propose as a decoy, commander?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.07,0:08:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有嘲笑鸟 别低估了她的作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have the Mockingjay. Don't underestimate her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.62,0:08:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以用她瓦解敌人内部\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could use her to erode support.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.74,0:09:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也许能让某些政府军动摇\N{\fnArial\fs30}She may be able to sway some of the loyalists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.41,0:09:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,科因女士 你在地下工事里待了很长一段时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been underground a long time, Madam Coin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.83,0:09:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里和施惠国其它地方不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't like the rest of Panem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.92,0:09:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这 支持都城的大有人在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Support for The Capitol runs deep here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.09,0:09:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么这里确实是一块难啃的硬骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then there is no sacrifice too great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.84,0:09:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要占领堡垒内部的武器库\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to control the arsenal inside that fortress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.76,0:09:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使我们全军出动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even with every district in this alliance, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.14,0:09:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,也显得人手不足\N{\fnArial\fs30}we are outgunned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.77,0:09:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是仅仅为了抢武器 我不会派我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't commit my people to a ground assault{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.56,0:09:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,地面部队进攻的\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to pillage weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.98,0:09:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩勒指挥官 我知道你的人民\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander Paylor, your people have suffered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.94,0:09:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,和其他仍然在都城控制下的人一样 饱经苦难\N{\fnArial\fs30}more than just about anyone else at the hands of The Capitol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.23,0:09:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是为什么我拒绝派我的部队继续进攻 那简直就是自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why I won't condone a mass suicide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.90,0:09:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们不拿下2区 我们就无法进攻都城\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't take District 2, we won't get into The Capitol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.65,0:09:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能够使堡垒瘫痪 因而不需要拿下它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would it be enough to disable the fortress… instead of taking it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.45,0:09:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you have in mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.58,0:09:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将它比作一个狼窝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think of it like a wolf den.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.16,0:09:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没办法直接闯进去 现在我们有两个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna fight your way in, so you've got two choices:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.04,0:09:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么你把狼困在里面 要么你把它们逼出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You trap the wolves inside, or you flush 'em out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.79,0:09:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没法直接攻进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can't attack straight on, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.21,0:09:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能不能派飞机对周围的\N{\fnArial\fs30}then couldn't we use our hovercraft{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.42,0:09:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,山区进行轰炸 我们利用地形\N{\fnArial\fs30}to strike around it? We'll use the mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.34,0:09:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道山峰的弱点在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll hit weak spots in the peaks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.59,0:09:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,利用一些地震方面的数据 我们设计一个炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could design the bomb targets in sequence using seismic data.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.09,0:09:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,来引发山体滑坡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trigger avalanches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.59,0:10:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,堵住所有的出口 切断他们的供应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Block all exits, cut off their supplies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.18,0:10:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们的飞机无法起飞和降落\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make it impossible for them to launch their hovercraft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.93,0:10:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,活埋他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bury them alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.77,0:10:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们放弃对他们武器库的进攻计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd forfeit any chance to control the weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.14,0:10:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我们这么做大大削弱都城的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but we'd face a weakened Capitol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.77,0:10:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那里面还有平民\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's civilians in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.32,0:10:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该留个投降的机会给他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They should be given a chance to surrender.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.73,0:10:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,保留一个补给隧道 以便他们的人撤出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could use one of the supply tunnels for the evacuees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.99,0:10:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这比12区的遭遇要好太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a luxury we weren't given when they firebombed 12.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.61,0:10:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有更好的解决方法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be a better way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.78,0:10:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我提议我们制造山崩封住出口 但保留火车隧道畅通\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest we try the avalanche, but leave the train tunnel alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.04,0:10:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,平民可以跑到广场上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Civilians can escape into the square, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.04,0:10:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的部队可以在那接受他们的投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}where our armies will be waiting for their surrender.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.92,0:10:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,让所有的医疗人员在那边待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should have every available medic standing by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.38,0:10:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们不投降呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if they won't surrender?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.25,0:10:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我们需要一个有说服力的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we will need a compelling voice…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.13,0:10:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,来劝降\N{\fnArial\fs30}to persuade them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.32,0:10:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,红旗 我是蓝色领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red flag, this is blue leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.65,0:10:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,从查利探戈集合起飞 高度1500米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Form up on Charlie Tango, 1, 500 meters out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.24,0:11:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有轰炸机都出边境\N{\fnArial\fs30}All bombers are outbound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.25,0:11:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有什么区别呢 凯特尼斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the difference, Katniss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.96,0:11:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,把敌人活埋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crushing the enemy in a mine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.37,0:11:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者用你的箭将敌人的飞机击落\N{\fnArial\fs30}or blowin' them outta the sky with one of Beetee's arrows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.29,0:11:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全就是一码事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the same thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.50,0:11:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在8区被空袭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were under attack in District 8, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.26,0:11:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我们击落的飞机里没有平民\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that hovercraft wasn't filled with civilians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.34,0:11:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那有什么关系呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.01,0:11:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕那些平民只是拖拖地板\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if those civilians are just moppin' floors, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.93,0:11:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是在帮敌人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're helping the enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.43,0:11:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得干掉他们没什么问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if they have to die, I can live with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.48,0:11:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,支持都城的没一个好东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one who supports The Capitol is innocent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.48,0:11:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这种滥杀无辜的思想也好不到哪去\N{\fnArial\fs30}With that kinda thinking, you can kill whoever you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.81,0:11:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了保持各区的秩序 你就把孩子送到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can send kids off to The Hunger Games{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.40,0:11:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,饥饿游戏的赛场中去\N{\fnArial\fs30}to keep the districts in line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.20,0:11:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特尼斯 这是战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's war, Katniss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.49,0:11:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时杀戮不是出于个人恩怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes killing isn't personal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.99,0:11:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且谁又会知道是我们做的呢？只是你自己太偏执罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figured if anyone knew that, it was you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.75,0:11:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都明白 战争总是和个人私欲紧密相连\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, of all people, know that it's always personal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.78,0:12:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特尼斯 不用担心 会有幸存者的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, Katniss, there'll be survivors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.58,0:12:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在想想你待会要说些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's focus on what it is you gotta say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.92,0:12:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,普鲁塔克已经拟好了演讲稿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Plutarch wrote a speech for you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.88,0:12:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会念那份稿子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not saying that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.96,0:12:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我也觉得你不会 只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Didn't think so. Let's, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.51,0:12:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是提醒你 你的演讲会被直播\N{\fnArial\fs30}But just remember, you're talking to everybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.76,0:12:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,起义军 都城的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just the rebels, but The Capitol, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.09,0:12:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,2区的幸存者\N{\fnArial\fs30}the survivors in 2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.05,0:12:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会看到你的演讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want them to lay down their arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.35,0:12:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你的演讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you might wanna experiment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.85,0:12:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,要有足够的煽动性 热情\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a little sensitivity, warmth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.69,0:12:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,演讲简练些 要让他们大吃一惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it quick, you're exposed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.21,0:13:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是凯特尼斯·艾佛丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Katniss Everdeen, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.42,0:13:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在2区的腹地向这些仍然忠于都城的人们发表讲话\N{\fnArial\fs30}speaking to all of the loyalists from the heart of District 2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.18,0:13:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸存者的乘坐的火车来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Survivors! Inbound!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.68,0:13:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready! Ready! Guns up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.81,0:13:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人就位 架起枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the ready. Guns up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.81,0:13:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要保护你撤下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get you back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.19,0:13:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here they come!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.11,0:13:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,握紧武器 握紧武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapons tight! Weapons tight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.03,0:13:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人靠后站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody, stand by!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.74,0:13:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the ground!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.91,0:13:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your weapons down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.04,0:13:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on the ground!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.83,0:13:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下你们的武器 马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your weapons down now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.04,0:13:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapons down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.00,0:14:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}You! Put it down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.34,0:14:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下.\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.13,0:14:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放下武器 - 放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Put your weapons down! - Drop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.97,0:14:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器 你 放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop your weapon! You! Drop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.93,0:14:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop the gun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.47,0:14:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.97,0:14:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别开枪 - 都别开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold your fire! - Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.43,0:14:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.14,0:14:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别开枪 - 都别开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold your fire! - Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.31,0:14:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别开枪 - 他需要治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold your fire! - He needs help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.19,0:14:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.61,0:14:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.44,0:14:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一个不开枪杀你的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me one reason I shouldn't shoot you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.57,0:14:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop the gun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.91,0:14:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.09,0:14:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这就是问题所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that's the problem, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.88,0:14:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们炸了你们的矿井\N{\fnArial\fs30}We blew up your mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.72,0:14:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们把我们的家乡夷为平地\N{\fnArial\fs30}You burned my district to the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.51,0:14:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们每个人都有相互残杀的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}We each have every reason to want to kill each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.44,0:15:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you wanna kill me, do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.15,0:15:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,某个人会很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make Snow happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.07,0:15:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经厌倦和斯诺的棋子互相杀戮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tired of killing his slaves for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.28,0:15:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不是他的棋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not his slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.95,0:15:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.53,0:15:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是为什么我杀了加图\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Why I killed Cato.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.54,0:15:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀了斯莱士\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he killed Thresh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.96,0:15:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯莱士杀了克拉芙\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Thresh killed Clove.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.96,0:15:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是这样不停的循环下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just goes around and around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.00,0:15:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后你猜谁赢了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who wins?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.21,0:15:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 赢家总是斯诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always Snow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.51,0:15:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经厌倦了成为他游戏里的棋子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am done being a piece in his game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.51,0:15:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,12区 2区 我们本来能和平共处\N{\fnArial\fs30}District 12, District 2. We have no fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.77,0:15:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争是都城挑起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except the one The Capitol gave us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.81,0:15:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你要抵抗我们起义军呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you fighting the rebels?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.40,0:15:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要与你的邻居兵戎相见呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're neighbors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.28,0:15:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要与你的家人手足相残呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.72,0:16:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人不是你们的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people are not your enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.97,0:16:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只有一个敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all have one enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.98,0:16:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是斯诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's Snow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.52,0:16:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让我们每个人堕落腐化\N{\fnArial\fs30}He corrupts everyone and everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.61,0:16:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们这些本该和睦相处的人相互残杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}He turns the best of us against each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.49,0:16:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再为他卖命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop killing for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.41,0:16:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 我们把枪口对准都城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight, turn your weapons to The Capitol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.17,0:16:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,对准斯诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn your weapons to Snow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.17,0:16:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 把你的枪口对准都城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight, turn your weapons to The Capitol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.76,0:16:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,对准斯诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn your weapons to Snow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.10,0:17:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.07,0:17:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}A toast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.61,0:17:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,安东尼奥斯 我们最精锐的部队已经阵亡在那座山里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Antonius, with our best troops crushed in the mountains{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.83,0:17:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在我们谈话的时候 敌人还在向我们进军\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the rebels marching on us as we speak, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.87,0:17:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我想问问 我们到底在庆祝什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what did we celebrate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.50,0:17:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 我认为我们在庆祝嘲笑鸟之死\N{\fnArial\fs30}The death of the Mockingjay, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.34,0:17:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然皮塔没能杀了她 她的自大葬送了自己的性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Peeta didn't kill her, her own arrogance did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.06,0:17:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.57,0:17:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,同样也是这么一种肤浅的思想 让你做出了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the same facile thinking{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.49,0:17:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我们最为精锐的部队派进2区这样一个错误的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}that led you to divert our best Peacekeepers into District 2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.66,0:18:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有一个坏习惯 喜欢在一切还未尘埃落定时就盖棺定论\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a habit of burying people before they're dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.12,0:18:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果嘲笑鸟真的死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the Mockingjay were gone, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.37,0:18:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛军会利用她的烈士形象大肆宣传\N{\fnArial\fs30}the rebels would already be using her as a martyr.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.38,0:18:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,安东尼奥斯首相 你说的不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Minister Antonius, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.55,0:18:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们不是在庆祝嘲笑鸟之死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid that is not what we were toasting at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.13,0:18:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 我们的部队能抵抗住叛军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, the rebels can be held off out…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.18,0:18:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛军几天后就会抵达\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rebels will reach the outskirts of The Capitol{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.85,0:18:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,都城的外围\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a matter of days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.69,0:18:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把外围街区的军队撤下来 放叛军进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll evacuate the outer blocks to let them in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.36,0:18:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,把所有的防空导弹准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want all anti-aircraft defenses ready, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.45,0:18:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,保住制空权\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we're secure from the skies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.70,0:18:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,放他们进城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lure them into the city, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.99,0:18:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们布下的陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then our Gamemakers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.20,0:18:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,会让他们每前进一步都得付出惨痛的代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}will make them pay for every inch with blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.42,0:18:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,让所有的探头监控这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want every camera watching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.42,0:18:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要让他们的前进变成一种折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll turn their advance into a celebration of suffering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.51,0:19:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们的子孙后代有机会欣赏那些场景\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let each moment be captured for all posterity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.43,0:19:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 安东尼奥斯首相 我们到底在庆祝什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what did we toast tonight, Minister Antonius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.81,0:19:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在庆祝一个光辉的时代\N{\fnArial\fs30}We toasted a glorious era…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.24,0:19:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于可悲的结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…coming to its bitter end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.50,0:19:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到你了 嘲笑鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there she is. The Mockingjay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.67,0:19:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 看看我身上这些伤疤 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that speech you gave. Oh, man, feel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.17,0:19:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在回想起来还会浑身起鸡皮疙瘩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I still have goose bumps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.05,0:19:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该不会介意吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't mind, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.97,0:19:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没再给我注射吗啡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They cut off my supply of morphling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.97,0:19:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个主治医生每天都来看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's this head doctor that comes in and sees me every day, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.47,0:19:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝试着 让我适应这里的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to help me adjust to reality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.60,0:19:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,仿佛就像这个兔子窝里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like some guy from this rabbit's warren{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.27,0:19:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的有人了解我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}actually knows anything about my reality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.36,0:20:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次开会时他都要重申好几遍：你是安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least 20 times in a session, he tells me that I'm totally safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.12,0:20:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会受到都城的迫害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safe from The Capitol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.45,0:20:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是遭受斯诺的暴政\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safe from Snow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.46,0:20:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘲笑鸟 你怎么看 你真的有安全感吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you, Mockingjay? You feeling totally safe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.58,0:20:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 直到在我中弹前 - 哦 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Till I got shot. - Oh, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.50,0:20:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那子弹根本没碰到你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bullet didn't even touch you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.67,0:20:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们考虑过这件事 你身上的「戏服」当然是防弹的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cinna saw to that. Of course, your costume would be bulletproof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.01,0:20:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你到底受了什么伤呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what are your injuries?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.93,0:20:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,肋骨和肺部受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruised ribs, bruised lung.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.64,0:20:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,真奇怪 他们怎么不给你换个新的肺\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm surprised they haven't found you a new lung.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.85,0:20:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我身上有两个肺呢 要不要从我身上拿一个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I've got two. Do you want one of mine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.61,0:20:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 每个人都要保护你的生命安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's everybody's job to keep you alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.98,0:20:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这就是你讨厌我的原因吗 - 那只是部分原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that why you hate me? - Partly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.90,0:20:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的很虚伪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're also a little hard to swallow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.61,0:20:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个俗套的传奇故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole tacky romance drama{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.62,0:20:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,和那个扶弱济贫的表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the "defender of the hopeless" act.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.91,0:20:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽说你帮助弱者时不像是在演戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though it's not an act.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.83,0:20:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这一切都让你显得更加令人讨厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which makes it even more unbearable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.08,0:20:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,能够亲口说出这些真是感到如释重负啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel free to take any of this personally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.46,0:20:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该去当嘲笑鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have been the Mockingjay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.34,0:20:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想说什么就说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody else would tell you what to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.96,0:21:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没人看好我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But nobody likes me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.92,0:21:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 至少你还是自由的 - 也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're afraid of you. - Maybe here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.39,0:21:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是在别的地方 都城里的人们只因为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but… in The Capitol, you're the only thing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.43,0:21:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,而感到恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}that they're scared of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.19,0:21:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是些我家人带来的小玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just stuff my family brought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.70,0:21:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是皮塔带来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's from Peeta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.66,0:21:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.67,0:21:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,都城的那帮人真是让我们不得安宁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}They messed us up pretty good, didn't they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.67,0:21:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们给他看了些你在2区演讲的镜头\N{\fnArial\fs30}We showed him footage of your speech in 2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.18,0:21:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他脑子里还是有对你的真实记忆的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had real memories of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.55,0:21:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不代表我可以去看他了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That still doesn't mean I'm going in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.85,0:21:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经被捆住了 不会伤害你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's strapped down. He can't hurt you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.60,0:21:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不是那个意思 黑密契 我真的不想见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. This is different. Haymitch, I really don't want to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.44,0:21:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你想不想的问题 这都是为了皮塔好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter what you want. It's for Peeta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.06,0:22:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试没坏处的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the harm in trying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.75,0:22:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I watched you die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.00,0:22:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看起来真糟糕 - 你看起来好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You look terrible. - You've looked better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.22,0:22:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说这话时一点也不真诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not even remotely nice to say that to me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.97,0:22:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来就不是个真诚的人 你才是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was never the nice one. You were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.26,0:22:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我看你倒下去的时候 我想起了一些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I saw you die, I remembered something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.27,0:22:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,想起了那些面包\N{\fnArial\fs30}About the bread.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.56,0:22:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想起那是个雨天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember… you in the rain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.40,0:22:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我故意把面包烤焦\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I burned it on purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.61,0:22:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了送面包给你吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}To give it to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.45,0:22:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得我妈妈还揍了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember my mother hitting me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.79,0:23:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我没把那些焦面包扔给猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was supposed to give it to the pig.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.21,0:23:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那之前我好几天没吃东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the first we'd eaten in days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.80,0:23:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么可能为了你去受那样一顿毒打\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I take a beating like that for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.55,0:23:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你很善良 很大方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you were kind and generous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.89,0:23:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 人们都说你喜欢我 - 有人说我喜欢你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And people said you loved me. - Did people say you love me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.06,0:23:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是斯诺折磨你的原因 因为他想折磨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said that's why Snow tortured you. To hurt me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.31,0:23:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯诺说你所说的一切都是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snow says that everything that comes out of your mouth is a lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.19,0:23:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所知道的是要是\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is that I would have{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.69,0:23:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我把那些面包扔给猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}saved myself a lot of suffering, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.70,0:23:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就可以少受些折磨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I'd just given that bread to the pig.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.85,0:23:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想衷心的对你道声谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the only thing left to say is "thank you."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.93,0:24:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去都城\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to be in The Capitol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.73,0:24:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你的任务已经完成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you have done your job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.77,0:24:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘲笑鸟 你已经做的很好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been very successful as the Mockingjay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.32,0:24:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你成功的使所有区团结在一起 现在我们希望你好好休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've unified the districts. And now we want you to rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.45,0:24:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,保养好自己的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to heal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.45,0:24:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,起义军最后一次看见我的时候 我还躺在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last the rebels saw me, I was lying on the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.74,0:24:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特尼斯 你放心 我不会让我们之前的宣传付诸东流的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss, we won't let this momentum go to waste.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.58,0:24:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就在13区 就在这里拍一些短片\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll shoot more propos right here in 13, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.33,0:24:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,证明你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}showing them that you're alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.96,0:24:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该和部队待在一块\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should be with the troops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.21,0:24:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这和你上前线效果是一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be like being on the front lines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.33,0:24:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就我们的官兵所知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as the soldiers know, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.71,0:24:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被一颗子弹击中心脏但却幸存下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}you survived a bullet to the heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.76,0:24:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他们能明白为什么你没能和他们并肩作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think they'll understand why you're not with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.22,0:24:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们赢得这场战争之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we win this war, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.26,0:24:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就用飞机送你过去 接受他们的投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll fly you in for the surrender.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.64,0:24:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,受降典礼需要你出席\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll need you for the ceremony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.10,0:24:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我们来说至关重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're very valuable to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.31,0:24:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我做什么都没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do whatever you need me to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.23,0:24:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,从今往后 无论是生老病死\N{\fnArial\fs30}From this day forth, in sickness and in health, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.90,0:24:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是富贵贫穷\N{\fnArial\fs30}for richer or poorer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.49,0:25:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都会好好的爱你 珍惜你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise to love and cherish you each day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.37,0:25:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 芬尼克·奥戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, Finnick Odair, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.96,0:25:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,与安妮 克莱斯塔结为夫妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}take you, Annie Cresta, as my wife from this day forth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.42,0:25:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一生一世\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together or apart, we will always be united.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.05,0:25:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,永不分离 志同道合 长相厮守\N{\fnArial\fs30}One life, one purpose, one destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.18,0:25:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你可以亲吻新娘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may kiss the bride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.30,0:26:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去看望了皮塔吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw Peeta, didn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.22,0:26:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有替我向他问好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you tell him "Hi" for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.27,0:26:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他可是我的老朋友啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're old friends, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.35,0:26:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在都城被关在同一间牢房里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had adjoining cells in The Capitol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.31,0:26:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对彼此的尖叫声都十分熟悉呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're very familiar with each other's screams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.69,0:26:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去杀了斯诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to kill Snow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.86,0:26:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要他活着一天我们就一天不得安生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing good is safe while he's alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.12,0:26:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀他之前我不想再演讲一番了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can't make another speech about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.50,0:26:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想再对着镜头 不想再拍宣传片\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more cameras. No more propos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.21,0:26:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想再演戏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more Games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.09,0:26:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我杀他的时候 我要他看着我的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs to see my eyes when I kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.89,0:26:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘲笑鸟终于开始有主见啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.77,0:26:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想有没有别的法子去都城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find a way to The Capitol when everybody's looking the other way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.69,0:26:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚听到有几个医务人员在聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear the medics talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.02,0:26:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们今天半夜要把物资\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're shipping supplies for the front line{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.78,0:26:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,送到前线去\N{\fnArial\fs30}from hangar two around midnight tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.49,0:27:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本打算从中偷点止痛药之类的药品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medicine, painkillers. I was gonna go steal some for myself, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.82,0:27:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想了想 我可以留在这为你作掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I guess I could just stay here and cover for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.91,0:27:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特尼斯 即使他是总统 你也能杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody can kill anybody, Katniss. Even a president.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.92,0:27:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你愿意牺牲自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just have to be willing to sacrifice yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.18,0:27:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.64,0:27:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想让斯诺看到你跳舞吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you want Snow to see you dance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.18,0:30:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, that's her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.02,0:30:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是凯特尼斯·艾佛丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Katniss Everdeen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.13,0:30:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 我以为你还在医院里呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Thought you were in the hospital.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.55,0:30:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前是呆在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.97,0:30:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.56,0:30:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,她去那里干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is she doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.14,0:31:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真是令人沮丧啊 她自己跑出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, it's so frustrating when she goes rogue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.69,0:31:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是一个教训那么简单 这是敢违抗命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't just adolescent, it's insubordination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.86,0:31:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,让第一架回来的飞机把她送回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put her on the first hovercraft back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.61,0:31:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,说什么呢 现在不能让她回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be ridiculous. She can't come back now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.11,0:31:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她现在就是个传奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's mythic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.66,0:31:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,在前线受了枪伤 却活了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the front lines, surviving a gunshot wound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.41,0:31:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都写不出一个比这更好的剧本了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't have staged it better myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.87,0:31:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.38,0:31:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她待在前线吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's going to stay where she is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.43,0:31:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她所做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whatever she's doing, we conceived it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.05,0:31:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是在我们的计划掌控之中的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was our plan all along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.47,0:31:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course it was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.19,0:31:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,海文斯比先生 你是游戏设计者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Heavensbee, you're the Gamemaker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.11,0:31:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让所有人知道无论她采取什么行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want everyone to know, whatever game she's playing, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.99,0:31:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她都是在为我们卖命\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's playing for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.41,0:32:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是第八区的指挥官佩勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Commander Paylor of District 8.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.00,0:32:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你们一样 都是在前线浴血奋战的士兵 我想说的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a soldier, like all of you, so here's what I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.21,0:32:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们一生中第一次看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the first time in our lifetimes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.17,0:32:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,13个区的人们在一起并肩作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're standing together with 13 districts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.55,0:32:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为我们已经创造了历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}From what I see here, we've already made history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.64,0:32:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们不应该就此满足\N{\fnArial\fs30}But history doesn't stop to celebrate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.94,0:32:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正面对冥顽不灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're facing an enemy that will not change{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.65,0:32:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,拒绝投降的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and will never surrender.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.69,0:32:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯诺总统将部队撤下\N{\fnArial\fs30}President Snow has pulled back Peacekeepers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.57,0:32:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,加强了城中心的守卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}to fortify the center of the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.11,0:32:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正从都城外围撤离居民\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's evacuating residents from the outer blocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.86,0:32:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,平民们感到恐慌绝望\N{\fnArial\fs30}These civilians will be confused and desperate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.24,0:32:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我命令你们不能伤害平民\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are under orders not to target them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.41,0:32:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会部署医疗兵来帮助这些需要帮助的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're deploying medical brigades to help anyone in need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.46,0:32:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要向都城人民证明我们是善良的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll show The Capitol people who we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.96,0:32:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了迟缓我们的进攻 斯诺总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}To slow our advance, President Snow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.71,0:32:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,在城内布下了许多地雷和陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}is building a minefield of traps{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.09,0:32:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一些被称作「豆荚」的杀人装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}and lethal devices called "pods."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.97,0:32:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种以我们的死亡为乐的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sadistic inventions of Gamemakers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.97,0:32:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,虐杀性武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}meant to make sport of our deaths.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.35,0:33:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们的部队能闯过城中的陷阱和守卫关卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}If our armies make it past Peacekeepers and other defenses, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.56,0:33:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将包围斯诺的宅邸\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll converge in the center of the city at Snow's mansion, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.89,0:33:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时我们将不仅仅是轰开他的大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}where we won't just unlock his gates, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.69,0:33:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,还解放了整个施惠国\N{\fnArial\fs30}but unshackle all of Panem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.61,0:33:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们不幸阵亡 希望我们死的值得\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we die, let it be for a cause and not a spectacle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.37,0:33:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们活下来了 愿上天保佑我们施惠国\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we succeed, let it be for all of Panem, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.12,0:33:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的起义也会永垂不朽\N{\fnArial\fs30}and let it be forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.62,0:33:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 你们已经创造了历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you've already made history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.00,0:33:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但未来 我们的未来将在明日黎明\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the future, our future, starts tomorrow at dawn, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.00,0:33:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,掀开新的篇章\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we march together into The Capitol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.44,0:33:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是451小队的人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Squad 451?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.82,0:33:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来你已经准备好你的食物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you got your meals covered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.28,0:34:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我希望在走之前准备周全 - 别瞒着我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tryin' to be prepared. - Don't lie to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.75,0:34:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这辈子都在一起打猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been hunting together all our lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.75,0:34:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你这次想离开小队单独行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know when you're gonna go off on your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.88,0:34:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这次还打算把我扔下吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna leave me behind, too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.30,0:34:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为你的部下\N{\fnArial\fs30}As your fellow soldier, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.84,0:34:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议你还是和你的分队待在一起吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest that you stay with your unit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.60,0:34:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你一定要来 我也没法阻止你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I couldn't stop you if you wanted to come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.60,0:34:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍桑 艾佛丁 来见见大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hawthorne, Everdeen, come meet your new unit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.65,0:34:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是杰克逊中尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Lieutenant Jackson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.53,0:34:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我向你介绍一下与你同行的小队成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I wanna introduce you to your squad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.20,0:34:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是米歇尔少尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Second Lieutenant Mitchell, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.62,0:34:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,施惠国的神枪手\N{\fnArial\fs30}best sharpshooter in Panem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.66,0:34:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两位 列格姐妹 来自第一战斗师\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are the Leeg sisters. First Combat Division.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.83,0:34:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是霍姆斯下士\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is Corporal Homes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.21,0:34:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬尼克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finnick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.47,0:34:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你和我们一起去吗？- 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you with us? - Looks like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.59,0:35:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜜月期真短啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a short honeymoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.18,0:35:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.68,0:35:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想在我们拿下都城后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we're gonna have to have one in The Capitol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.56,0:35:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们会在那再度一次蜜月 - 集合\N{\fnArial\fs30}- After we take it. - Gather 'round.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.11,0:35:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,451中队 我是你们的总指挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Squad 451, you're my unit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.15,0:35:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克逊中尉是副指挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant Jackson is my second-in-command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.36,0:35:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们中的每一个人都是战场上的精英\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each one of you is elite in some form of combat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.78,0:35:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们不是战斗部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we are a non-combat unit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.12,0:35:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们将跟在前线部队后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we'll be following days behind the front-line troops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.66,0:35:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为明星小队\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're to be the onscreen faces of the invasion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.96,0:35:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的行动将被直播\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The Star Squad."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.25,0:35:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥部认为直播你们的行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been decided that you're most effective{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.34,0:35:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能鼓舞军心 - 所以我们不参加战斗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- when seen by the masses. - So we're not gonna fight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.38,0:35:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,士兵 我命令你做什么你就做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll do whatever you're ordered to do, soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.26,0:35:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在轮不到你提问\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not your job to ask questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.47,0:35:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.93,0:35:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们接到的指示是在进军都城时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our instructions are to shoot propaganda footage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.85,0:35:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,拍摄宣传镜头\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the battle-scarred streets of The Capitol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.47,0:35:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们每个人都是被精心挑选出来 去震慑敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were handpicked to intimidate their forces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.94,0:35:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,劝诫他们投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}And inspire surrenders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.85,0:35:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使我们大多数时间都在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though we'll be working on abandoned streets{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.77,0:35:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,离前线数英里的街道上拍摄\N{\fnArial\fs30}miles behind the front lines, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.23,0:35:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你们担保 无论他把我们派到哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guarantee you, wherever they put us, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.90,0:36:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不会绝对的安全 我们将身处战场\N{\fnArial\fs30}it will not be safe. This is a war zone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.15,0:36:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可能遇到活动的「豆荚」\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is likely that we'll encounter both active pods{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.78,0:36:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,和敌人的部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Peacekeepers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.66,0:36:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是都城的重点抓捕目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're considered high-value targets to The Capitol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.74,0:36:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是不幸落入敌手\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the event of capture, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.41,0:36:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,用这种「夜锁」药丸自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll be given a nightlock pill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.33,0:36:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,服用后毒性立马发作\N{\fnArial\fs30}A poison that acts immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.67,0:36:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克逊中尉请将药丸分发下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant Jackson, do the honors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.96,0:36:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你们简要介绍下「豆荚」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've already briefed you on the pods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.17,0:36:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,仔细听好了 每个街区上都有这种陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remind you, they are on every block.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.18,0:36:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,上级给我们小队分配了一个「全息图」装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our unit has been given a Holo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.47,0:36:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个数据库 内置都城的详细地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}A database that contains a detailed map of The Capitol{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.18,0:36:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面记录了每一个已知「豆荚」的具体位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a list of every known pod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.27,0:36:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些陷阱能被例如炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}These pods can trigger anything from bombs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.10,0:36:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一些不幸靠近的倒霉蛋触发\N{\fnArial\fs30}to traps to mutts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.56,0:36:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有这个装置我们就无法行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot move without this device.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.65,0:36:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时这个数据库可能是不完整的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no guarantee that our database is complete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.94,0:36:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可能有我们尚未注意到的「豆荚」\N{\fnArial\fs30}There could be new pods that we're not aware of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.86,0:36:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不想让敌人知道我们有这么清楚的情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we don't want the Gamemakers to know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.41,0:36:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此装置内部有一个自毁装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have this intel, it has a self-destruct on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.45,0:36:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你启动这个开关 说三声「夜锁」\N{\fnArial\fs30}You flip this switch, say "nightlock" three times, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.87,0:36:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就会自爆 爆炸半径10英寸\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it blows itself and anything within a 10-foot radius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.66,0:36:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要擅自行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay within our unit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.71,0:36:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便我们有这个装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even with the Holo, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.29,0:36:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人也可能布下新的「豆荚」\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is likely that new pods have been set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.30,0:37:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管那里面是什么 那肯定能要了你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever they contain, they are meant to kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.97,0:37:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们女士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.05,0:37:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到第76届饥饿游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}welcome to the 76th Hunger Games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.33,0:37:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未见过这里空无一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen this place so empty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.59,0:37:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家留心观察周围情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep your eyes open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.07,0:38:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这附近有个陷阱快找隐蔽物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a pod. Let's take cover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.87,0:38:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这两栋楼中间射一箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot through those two buildings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.54,0:38:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,陷阱 就在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pollux… right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.59,0:38:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷西达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.22,0:38:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,位置不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.22,0:38:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特尼斯 准备好了就射击\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you're ready, Katniss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.11,0:38:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意 豆荚机更密集了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it. Pollux, tighter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.94,0:38:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,开弓吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.68,0:39:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,警报解除\N{\fnArial\fs30}All clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.65,0:39:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们走不过这片雷区的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think we can get across this minefield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.65,0:39:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有「全息图」就没法过雷区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not without that Holo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.78,0:39:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥官醒着时我们没法拿走那个装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna get it off him while he's awake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.61,0:39:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得校正我们俩的手表 今晚统一行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's make sure we're on the same watch tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.66,0:39:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是政府军的卡车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that Peacekeepers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.88,0:39:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,451小队呼叫基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}451 to base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.55,0:39:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,一辆卡车从南面驶向我们的驻地 完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got a truck coming in from the south. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.67,0:39:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,小队明白 完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.97,0:39:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必紧张 那是自己人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand down, everyone. It's friendly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.51,0:40:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫皮塔·梅拉尔克\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Peeta Mellark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.80,0:40:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来自12区\N{\fnArial\fs30}My home is District 12.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.14,0:40:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫皮塔·梅拉尔克 我来自12区\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Peeta Mellark. My home is District 12.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.69,0:40:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 停下 - 我叫皮塔·梅拉尔克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, stop. - My name is Peeta Mellark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.65,0:40:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 住手 大家都冷静 - 我叫皮塔·梅拉尔克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold up. Everyone relax. - My home is District 12.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.90,0:40:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拿他怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we doin'?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.94,0:40:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克逊 铐上他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jackson, cuff him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.29,0:41:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,士兵 这只是保险措施\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soldier, this is just a precaution{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.83,0:41:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄清楚情况后我们会给你解开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}till we can get everything straightened out. Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.54,0:41:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫皮塔·梅拉尔克 我来自12区\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name's Peeta Mellark. From District 12.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.88,0:41:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,上级希望我们将他拍进宣传片\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want us to add him to the propo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.63,0:41:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,以证明他现在已经站到我们这边了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show that he's on our side now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.89,0:41:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天 我们往前走几个街区\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll move forward a few blocks tomorrow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.76,0:41:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,再给他拍一个短片\N{\fnArial\fs30}and shoot the new footage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.18,0:41:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他甚至都不能控制住自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not in control of himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.72,0:41:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我安排一个值班表 轮流看守他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we schedule an around-the-clock watch on him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.64,0:41:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,到17点 由列格姐妹俩负责 由赫姆斯和米歇尔负责到19点\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Leegs till 1700, Homes and Mitchell till 1900.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.48,0:41:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我也安排进值班表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.78,0:41:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了关键时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if it really came down to it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.03,0:41:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定你能朝他开枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you think you could shoot him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.36,0:41:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时我不是朝皮塔开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't be shooting Peeta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.66,0:41:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是朝一个都城来的杂种开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be killing a Capitol mutt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.66,0:41:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样说更让我不放心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure that kind of a comment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.20,0:41:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以让你胜任这份工作 士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}recommends you for the job, either, soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.16,0:41:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她排进值班表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put her in the rotation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.10,0:42:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定会试图杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna try to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.36,0:42:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是当我们行动的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially with all this going on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.81,0:42:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,会使他不受控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna set him off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.44,0:42:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会牢牢看住他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll keep him contained.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.82,0:42:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么科因这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would Coin do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.87,0:42:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所知道的有限\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's all I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.29,0:42:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那次在竞技场里她想救出来的是皮塔而不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Peeta that she wanted rescued from the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.87,0:42:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一点都不喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She never liked you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.83,0:42:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不喜欢那些她控制不住的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't like anybody or anything she can't control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.54,0:42:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以她就让我置身于危险的境地？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So she would put my life in danger?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.71,0:42:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说她不是故意为之 但实际上\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'd deny it, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.05,0:42:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.63,0:42:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天这场战争要结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}One way or another, this war is gonna come to an end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.80,0:42:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们承诺将会举行一场自由的选举\N{\fnArial\fs30}They promised a free election.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.89,0:42:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许她已经将你视作一个威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe she's startin' to see you as a threat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.64,0:42:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会支持我做领导人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody would think I'd be a leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.56,0:42:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果要你支持某位候选人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you'd throw your support to someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.31,0:42:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会选她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would it be her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.94,0:42:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不是毫不犹豫的回答道「会」\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if your immediate answer isn't "yes, "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.70,0:42:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你对她来说就是个威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you're dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.91,0:43:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,她已经不需要你拍摄那些宣传片了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't need you as a rallying cry anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.37,0:43:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这些宣传片没有你一样也能拍下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}These propos can be done without you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.29,0:43:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只有最后一件事可以做\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one thing you could do now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.87,0:43:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让反抗的火焰燃得更旺\N{\fnArial\fs30}to add more fire to this rebellion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.37,0:43:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.00,0:43:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特尼斯 我是不会让这种事情发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not gonna happen under my watch, Katniss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.50,0:43:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会好好保护你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm plannin' for you to have a long life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.30,0:43:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 你为什么要这么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? You don't owe me anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.76,0:43:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你值得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you've earned it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.52,0:43:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我们以前一起到过这儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been here before, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.61,0:43:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.11,0:43:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脸上的表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}That look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.62,0:43:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这表情我以前看到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen that look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.37,0:43:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时你在决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're trying to decide{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.12,0:43:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底要不要杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}whether or not you should kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.25,0:43:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没想过要杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never wanted to kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.42,0:43:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我心里想的不是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's not what I'm doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.09,0:44:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们第一届在饥饿游戏上见面时 我亲眼所见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw it with my own eyes. In the first Games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.34,0:44:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那次 我以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the first Games, I thought you were{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.68,0:44:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要和卡瑞尔一起杀掉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to help the Careers kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.72,0:44:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那之后 我把你当成我的伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}After that, I always saw you… as an ally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.94,0:44:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友 爱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friend, lover…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.82,0:44:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜利者\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Victor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.24,0:44:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,未婚妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}…fiancé, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.11,0:44:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人 攻击目标 杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}…enemy, target, mutt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.82,0:44:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在又成了盟友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now ally?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.79,0:44:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我要把这个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'll add that to the list of words{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.54,0:44:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,加到我用来琢磨你的一串词里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I use to try to figure you out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.17,0:44:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.88,0:44:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是没法分清事实的真假了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't tell what's real and what's made up anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.14,0:44:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就多开口问问大家 安妮也是这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then ask. It's what Annie does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.68,0:44:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,问谁呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.93,0:44:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,问我们 我们是你的新同伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Us. We're your unit now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.49,0:45:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最喜欢的颜色是绿色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your favorite color is green.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.82,0:45:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that real?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.70,0:45:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是绿色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That's real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.83,0:45:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最喜欢的颜色是橙色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours is orange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.38,0:45:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…应该是亮橙色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bright orange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.80,0:45:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,像日落一样温暖的亮橙色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soft, like the sunset.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.43,0:45:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.98,0:45:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾是个画家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a painter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.44,0:45:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个面包师\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a baker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.86,0:45:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总喜欢开着窗户睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always sleep with the windows open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.53,0:45:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喝茶时从不加糖\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never take sugar in your tea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.45,0:45:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你系鞋带总是打双结\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always double-knot your shoelaces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.66,0:45:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.63,0:46:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.60,0:46:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们走不掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess we're not leavin' anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.93,0:46:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿不到全息仪我们哪都去不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not going anywhere without that Holo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.23,0:46:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位听好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.44,0:46:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个弹夹是空的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mag's empty…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.20,0:46:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了他拍宣传片而准备的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only for the propo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.79,0:46:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们继续前进 向北走五个街区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move. We're headed five blocks north.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.43,0:46:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,都城里的平民们\N{\fnArial\fs30}"To the citizens of The Capitol, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.01,0:46:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会伤害你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}our war is not with you."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.72,0:46:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,都城里的平民们\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the citizens of The Capitol, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.10,0:46:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会伤害你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}our war is not with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.06,0:47:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争结束后 你们也享有平等的民主权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You will be a vital part of the democracy that follows our victory."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.44,0:47:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争结束后 你们也享有平等的民主权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be a vital part of the democracy that follows our victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.36,0:47:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 记住了吗 - 记住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got it. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.46,0:47:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,博格斯 这个拍摄点不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boggs. This is a good spot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.76,0:47:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,走到那 到那个广场上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Through there, in the courtyard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.39,0:47:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 让我们先探测一下周围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let us clear it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.53,0:47:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现了一个陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a pod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.08,0:47:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,分散 找掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Split. Take cover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.17,0:48:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,别靠近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.99,0:48:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,警报解除 盖尔 赫姆斯跟着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}All clear. Gale, Homes, with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.16,0:48:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,列格姐妹 注意两翼的动向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leegs, take the wings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.23,0:49:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾佛丁 别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everdeen, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.69,0:49:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,博格斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boggs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.82,0:49:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所有人站在原地 - 博格斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold your position! - Boggs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.28,0:49:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,把止血带从包里拿出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab the tourniquets from the bag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.82,0:49:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽力按住他的腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Squeeze his legs as hard as you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.74,0:49:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.87,0:49:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护好「全息图」\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Holo. The Holo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.45,0:49:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已不适合指挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfit for command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.71,0:49:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,移交指挥权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transfer primary security clearance…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.71,0:49:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say your name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.13,0:49:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特尼斯·艾佛丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss Everdeen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.13,0:49:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么这么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you just do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.30,0:49:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特尼斯 不要信任他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss, don't trust them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.72,0:49:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,必要时杀了皮塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill Peeta, if you have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.18,0:49:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别忘了你此行的目的 - 博格斯你醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do what you came to do. - Boggs? Boggs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.53,0:49:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 醒醒啊 - 他牺牲了 牺牲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. Come on. - He's gone. He's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.73,0:50:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.69,0:50:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走这边 - 不要停\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This way! - Keep moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.86,0:50:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特尼斯快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, soldiers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.11,0:50:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快跑到高处 - 跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get to higher ground! - Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.21,0:50:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finnick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.29,0:50:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 皮塔 - 米歇尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Peeta! - Mitchell!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.80,0:50:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.34,0:50:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞特尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Settle!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.05,0:50:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑 不要停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Don't stop! Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.43,0:51:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on! We gotta move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.26,0:51:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get inside!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.10,0:51:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都赶紧进去 快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody, inside! Go! Upstairs! Go! Hurry up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.27,0:51:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.44,0:51:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走 - 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go! Go! - Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.24,0:51:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep moving!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.87,0:51:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑到顶楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep moving to the top!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.08,0:51:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.30,0:51:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我抓住你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey! I got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.43,0:51:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,水位上涨的速度降低了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's slowing down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.12,0:52:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的性命仍然在他们的掌控中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gamemakers are still putting on quite a show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.41,0:52:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 451小队呼叫基地 完毕 - 各位 我们最好马上转移了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 451 to base. Over. - Hey, we better move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.21,0:52:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前政府军不知道我们的方位 现在他们知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Peacekeepers didn't know where we were, they do now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.04,0:52:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些监控探头发现了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those surveillance cameras caught us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.21,0:52:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,451小队呼叫基地 请回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}451 to base. Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.80,0:52:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,此地不宜久待 我们必须马上走\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a bad spot. We need to move now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.93,0:52:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,451小队呼叫基地 完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}451 to base. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.51,0:52:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get a signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.47,0:52:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道回基地的路线 艾佛丁 把「全息图」给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can get us back to base. Everdeen, give me the Holo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.81,0:52:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾佛丁 我重复一遍 快给我 我们要行动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everdeen, what did I just say? The Holo. Come on, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.36,0:52:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,博格斯把它给了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boggs gave it to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.15,0:52:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都在说些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.53,0:52:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,博格斯确实这么做了 他将指挥权移交给了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did. He transferred security clearance to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.28,0:52:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲眼所见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.83,0:52:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么这么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why would he do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.45,0:52:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,科因总统给了我一个特殊任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on special orders from Coin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.83,0:52:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么任务？\N{\fnArial\fs30}To do what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.71,0:52:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,暗杀斯诺总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}To assassinate President Snow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.46,0:53:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不信 不用多想就知道你在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe that for one second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.55,0:53:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为小队的新指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}As your new unit commander, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.63,0:53:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我命令你现在就将安全许可移交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I order you to transfer security clearance to me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.93,0:53:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.06,0:53:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们暂且先别窝里斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's not lose our heads here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.48,0:53:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是在请求你 艾佛丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not asking you again, Everdeen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.19,0:53:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,把「全息图」给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that Holo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.20,0:53:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没骗你 普鲁塔希望这能在电视直播\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's telling the truth. Plutarch wants it televised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.49,0:53:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他觉得如果\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thinks if we could film{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.75,0:53:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,能把嘲笑鸟暗杀斯诺的过程拍下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Mockingjay assassinating Snow, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.66,0:53:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,都城能更快的投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'll make The Capitol surrender{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.25,0:53:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,避免更大的伤亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the casualties get too high.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.38,0:53:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,正当我们争执不休之时\N{\fnArial\fs30}While we're arguing, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.67,0:53:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,100名政府军正朝这逼近\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's 100 Peacekeepers on their way here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.51,0:53:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,博格斯曾经向我保证时机到来时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boggs promised me that when the time came, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.38,0:53:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定会帮我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you would help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.61,0:54:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 士兵 「全息图」是你的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, soldier, Holds yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.88,0:54:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们应该不会再被发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think we're gonna leave any footprints.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.67,0:54:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该马上行动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should move now. And those cameras outside{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.80,0:54:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面的大部分监控镜头都被油污遮住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}should be covered up by the oil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.92,0:54:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能继续前进了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can't move forward like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.38,0:54:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的腿伤得太重 我们需要带她撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her leg is too bad. We have to evacuate her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.30,0:54:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.47,0:54:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会和她待在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll stay with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.68,0:54:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我承诺我们一与指挥部联系上\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as we make contact, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.64,0:54:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就让他们派人来找你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}we will send somebody back. I promise you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.07,0:54:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 我们出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, everybody, move out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.48,0:54:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拉上他一起走 - 行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's get him up. - Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.78,0:54:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能自己走吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you walk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.53,0:55:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,走这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.35,0:55:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉上那些窗帘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get these curtains closed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.29,0:56:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,列格姐妹俩在劫难逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the Leegs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.78,0:56:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,下午好 我是凯萨·富莱克曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good afternoon. I'm Caesar Flickerman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.70,0:56:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面继续播报都城保卫战的最新战况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here with our continuing coverage of the defense of The Capitol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.28,0:57:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天 我们的部队正顽强抵抗着叛军的进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, as our Peacekeepers valiantly hold off the rebels, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.12,0:57:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要告诉大家一个好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}our story takes a surprising twist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.00,0:57:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特尼斯·艾佛丁 我们曾经的骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss Everdeen, our once favorite daughter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.92,0:57:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,与一些曾经的胜利者们渗透进城市内部\N{\fnArial\fs30}has infiltrated the city with some of the Victors, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.72,0:57:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的名字大家都很熟悉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}whose names are all too familiar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.05,0:57:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬尼克·奥戴尔和皮塔·梅尔拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finnick Odair and Peeta Mellark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.89,0:57:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显 没有永恒的盟友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly, some alliances don't last forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.69,0:57:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位观众看一看几分钟前发生的一幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a look at what happened just a moment ago, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.98,0:57:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们的部队包围了凯特尼斯·艾佛丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}when our Peacekeepers cornered Katniss Everdeen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.11,0:57:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,和她那一队愚蠢的同伙时\N{\fnArial\fs30}and her band of foolish rebels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.78,0:57:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论是怎样一种自大的想法驱使她回到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever arrogance brought this treacherous girl back to us, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.74,0:57:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们马上就要目睹我们胜利的一幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are about to witness a great victory, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.00,0:57:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅对都城而言 而是对所有施惠国而言\N{\fnArial\fs30}not only for The Capitol, but for Panem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.31,0:58:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 你们已经看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there you have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.10,0:58:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特尼斯·艾佛丁 燃烧的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss Everdeen, the Girl on Fire, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.27,0:58:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,她曾经引发了一场场暴动\N{\fnArial\fs30}a girl who inspired so much violence, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.15,0:58:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,到头来终究惨死\N{\fnArial\fs30}seems to have met a violent end herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.69,0:58:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,请继续关注我们的最新报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay tuned for more information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.49,0:58:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是凯萨·富莱克曼 感谢您的收看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar Flickerman. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.29,0:58:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他们以为我们死了 我们下一步怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now that we're dead, what are we gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.25,0:58:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还不清楚吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't it obvious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.92,0:58:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一步你们会干掉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next move is to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.30,0:58:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我害死了我的同伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I murdered one of our squad members.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.55,0:58:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特尼斯说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss is right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.31,0:58:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是个杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a mutt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.81,0:58:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我下一次发作只是时间问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's only a matter of time before I snap again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.23,0:58:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法控制自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not in control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.65,0:58:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一粒「夜锁」药丸 这样我就能自杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a nightlock pill, so I can die when I need to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.28,0:58:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是到了紧要关头 我会亲手杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it gets to that point, I'll kill you myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.97,0:59:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直不理解都城那些人的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I ever really understood The Capitol until now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.93,0:59:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吃了这个 你会相信一切的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You eat like this, you'll believe anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.63,1:00:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家也都看到了 凯特尼斯·艾佛丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Katniss Everdeen, a poor unstable girl{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.13,1:00:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,反复无常的小丫头\N{\fnArial\fs30}with nothing but a small talent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.47,1:00:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过只是擅长箭术 她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a bow and arrow, is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.93,1:00:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不聪明 也不配当领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a thinker, not a leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.81,1:00:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是一群贱民拉出来册封的勇士罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simply a face plucked from the masses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.15,1:00:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有用么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was she valuable?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.94,1:00:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于你们这伙人的革命当然有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was extremely valuable to your rebellion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.32,1:00:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你们毫无眼光 无法推选出一位优秀的领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you have no vision, no true leader among you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.24,1:00:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们将自己称作起义军\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call yourselves an alliance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.33,1:00:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我认为你们只不过是一群乌合之众罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we saw what that means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.91,1:00:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们部队内斗不断 士兵之间斗的你死我活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your soldiers are at each other's throats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.34,1:00:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们趁早安息去吧 施惠国人要是还有人不认识我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening. For those of you who don't know me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.09,1:00:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就自我介绍一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}please, allow me to introduce myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.09,1:00:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是总统阿尔玛·科因 起义军的领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am President Alma Coin, leader of the rebellion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.68,1:00:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之所以打断你们总统的广播\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have interrupted a broadcast from your President{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.35,1:00:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为他正试图抹黑一位年轻 勇敢的姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}in which he attempted to defame a brave young woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.40,1:00:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群贱民拉出来册封的勇士 他是这么称呼她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}"A face picked from the masses, " he called her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.48,1:00:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,册封\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plucked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.57,1:01:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位真正的领导 不用任何人册封\N{\fnArial\fs30}As if a leader, a true leader, could be anything else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.32,1:01:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很荣幸能认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had the privilege of knowing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.99,1:01:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位来自十二区的姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}a small-town girl from the Seam in District 12{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.79,1:01:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,她撑过了饥饿游戏和世纪争霸赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}who survived the Hunger Games and the Quarter Quell{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.79,1:01:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,并勇敢地站出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and rose up and turned{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.25,1:01:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,使一国之奴隶化为一支军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}a nation of slaves into an army!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.13,1:01:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管她是死是活 凯特尼斯·艾佛丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead or alive, Katniss Everdeen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.38,1:01:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是这次革命的象征\N{\fnArial\fs30}will remain the face of this revolution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.93,1:01:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的献身意义重大\N{\fnArial\fs30}She will not have died for nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.47,1:01:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我竟然不知道我对她这么重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no idea I meant so much to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.81,1:01:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她和我们的目标终将实现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her vision and ours will be realized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.23,1:01:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那将是一个自由的施惠国 人人独立自主\N{\fnArial\fs30}A free Panem with self-determination for all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.57,1:01:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,将她铭记于心 我们终将寻找到让施惠国\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in her memory, we will all find the strength{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.99,1:01:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,摆脱其压迫者的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}to rid Panem of its oppressors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.99,1:01:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 祝平安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. And be safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.12,1:01:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯诺在他的宅邸里 他的宅邸在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snow's in his mansion. Where is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.51,1:02:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.63,1:02:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是市中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the City Circle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.01,1:02:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,隔着大约70到75个街道\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's at least 70, 75 blocks north.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.81,1:02:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 75个？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Seventy-five blocks? - Uh-huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.85,1:02:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人知道我们还活着 我们能好好利用这个有利条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody knows we're alive. This is our chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.85,1:02:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这几栋楼 从那里看得见斯诺的花园么\N{\fnArial\fs30}These buildings. Do these look over Snow's gardens?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.65,1:02:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我 - 可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I… - They do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.44,1:02:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要他走出来 我就能一箭射死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he goes outside at all, I could get a clear shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.53,1:02:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,先别想那么远\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're getting ahead of ourselves here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.74,1:02:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管他们还在不在找我们 我们被困在这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whether they're looking for us or not, we are pinned down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.95,1:02:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,按那个按钮 把所有的「豆荚」搜出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit that button. Scan for pods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.04,1:02:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,走十步路就能撞见一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just about every ten steps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.75,1:02:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且新布下的陷阱的这儿还没显示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that doesn't even show the new ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.21,1:02:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以到了街上我们将寸步难行\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we can't go anywhere in the streets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.42,1:02:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这红点还真是密集啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the rooftops are just as bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.76,1:02:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也许能找到别的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}There might be another way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.47,1:02:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的兄弟对这些通道了如指掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother knows these tunnels really well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.35,1:02:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他原来在这儿的地下排污系统工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}He worked sanitation down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.15,1:02:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来他们割掉了他的舌头 真庆幸还留了他一条小命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right after they made him an Avox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.12,1:03:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.37,1:03:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？看着我 看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna be okay? Look at me. Look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.21,1:03:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定能安全穿过这里的 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get through this. I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.14,1:03:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们花了5年时间才把他赎出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took us five years to buy his way outta here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.85,1:03:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他才得以重见天日\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't see the sun once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.98,1:04:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这很容易被发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're too exposed here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.09,1:04:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 需要为您叫医生过来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, should I call for your doctor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.05,1:04:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么？- 需要为您叫医生过来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did you say? - Shall I call for your doctor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.68,1:04:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你叫醒我是因为有比一个老年人的健康状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you've wakened me for something more urgent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.93,1:05:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,更为紧急的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}than an old man's health.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.52,1:05:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没死 不知道怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}They survived. I don't know how.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.90,1:05:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在监控里发现了他们的踪迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}We picked them up on a surveillance cam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.07,1:05:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看 我…我需要亲自确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see. I… I need to see for myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.32,1:05:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.91,1:05:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.41,1:05:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来他们把战场转移到了地下\N{\fnArial\fs30}The arena has moved underground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.73,1:05:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.96,1:06:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.51,1:06:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.99,1:06:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, everybody, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.66,1:06:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里先停会休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna stop here for a bit and get some rest, yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.29,1:06:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我放第一班哨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take first watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.34,1:06:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮塔 走过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Peeta. Just tuck in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.39,1:07:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 大家都坐下休息吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, settle in, everybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.16,1:07:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特尼斯 轮到你放哨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss. Your watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.90,1:07:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该知道 都城\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, The Capitol, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.86,1:07:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们曾经用杀人蜂来对付我\N{\fnArial\fs30}they used trackerjacker venom on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.91,1:08:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,13区的医生告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what the doctors in 13 said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.16,1:08:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也被叮过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were stung once, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.58,1:08:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real or not real?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.62,1:08:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.71,1:08:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们对我下毒后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they used the venom on me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.71,1:08:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,会给我看我以前的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}they would show me pictures of my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.22,1:08:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是有些不是真实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But some weren't real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.59,1:08:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他们篡改过了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They changed them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.23,1:08:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一开始我分不清哪些是真实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}At first, they all… They all blurred together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.31,1:08:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我能分辨出一些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now… Now I can sort them out a little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.86,1:08:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是被他们改过的一小部分 有一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the ones that they changed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.53,1:08:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一些重声 就像是\N{\fnArial\fs30}they have this quality…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.11,1:08:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎闪闪发光 被美化过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like they're shiny. They've been glossed over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.45,1:08:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该好好休息下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should get some rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.62,1:08:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你仍在努力保护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still trying to protect me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.67,1:08:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real or not real?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.55,1:08:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.42,1:09:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you and I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.51,1:09:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,让对方活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep each other alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.37,1:10:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特尼斯 凯特尼斯 凯特尼斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss. Katniss. Katniss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.80,1:10:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特尼斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.52,1:10:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么声音？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.39,1:10:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该走了 我们必须马上离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta go. We gotta get outta here now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.02,1:10:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小声点 - 那是蜥蜴人 他们放出了蜥蜴人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Keep your voice down. - Mutts! They released mutts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.23,1:10:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,波力克斯 最快出去的路在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pollux, what's the fastest way out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.40,1:10:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 起来 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Go! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.18,1:13:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快跑 快跑 快跑 蜥蜴人 - 快点 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go! Go! Go! It's mutts! - Come on, come on, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.06,1:13:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,波力克斯 快带我们出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pollux, lead us out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.77,1:13:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.87,1:13:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克逊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.42,1:13:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡斯托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.01,1:13:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.13,1:13:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.81,1:14:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特妮斯 快走 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss, come on! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.78,1:15:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特妮斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.76,1:16:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 快…快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go, 90, 90!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.94,1:16:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.49,1:16:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特妮斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.90,1:17:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 芬尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Finnick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.49,1:17:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finnick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.37,1:17:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特妮斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.25,1:17:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜锁模式 夜锁模式 夜锁模式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nightlock. Nightlock. Nightlock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.46,1:17:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快走 快走 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on, come on. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.96,1:17:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 别停下来 别停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep moving! Keep moving!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.15,1:17:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! GO!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.07,1:17:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 别停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going! Keep going!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.68,1:18:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮塔 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peeta, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.10,1:18:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peeta!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.73,1:18:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮塔 我们得赶紧走 我是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peeta, we have to keep going!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.11,1:18:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得快走 我不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a mutt! I can't keep control!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.02,1:18:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可以 - 走开 我是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, you can! - Leave me! I'm a mutt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.61,1:18:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我 看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me! Look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.62,1:18:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,别离开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.29,1:18:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.70,1:18:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.96,1:18:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where we are!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.21,1:18:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道一个地方 在这楼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know a place. Up those stairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.72,1:18:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.41,1:19:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.58,1:19:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,关门 关上门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut the door, shut the door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.37,1:19:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 她是好人 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Katniss, it's okay, it's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.54,1:19:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.38,1:19:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,底格里斯 还记得我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tigris, do you remember me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.92,1:19:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是和普鲁塔克一伙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with Plutarch's underground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.76,1:19:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.26,1:19:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.70,1:20:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识你你是饥饿游戏的造型师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you. You were a stylist in the Games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.80,1:20:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是斯诺 我也不会变成这副模样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until Snow decided I wasn't pretty enough anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.68,1:20:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来杀他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hereto kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.85,1:20:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要缝合伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gale's gonna need stitches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.36,1:21:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我撒谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.62,1:21:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是我编的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.24,1:21:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,科因没有分配什么特别任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no special mission from Coin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.58,1:21:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是我个人的计划而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only my plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.00,1:21:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我害死了那么多同伴因为我说了假话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone that's dead is dead because of me. I lied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.67,1:21:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道 我们早就知道这些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know. We all knew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.76,1:21:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那些来自十三区的士兵们 - 他们也是这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The soldiers from 13? - They did, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.05,1:21:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真以为杰克逊相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really believe that Jackson thought{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.72,1:21:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,身负科因的命令吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you had orders from Coin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.27,1:21:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只信任博格斯 所以她想让你接着完成他的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}She trusted Boggs and he clearly wanted you to go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.77,1:21:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没想到事情会成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never meant for this to happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.57,1:21:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我辜负了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If ailed. I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.49,1:21:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我害死了他们 我害死了了芬尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed them. I killed Finnick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.91,1:22:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 波乐克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Pollux.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.92,1:22:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很对不起他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.29,1:22:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛利姆 马弗 玛格斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glimmer, Marvel, Mags…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.76,1:22:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉芙 瓦尔里斯 芸香\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Clove, Wiress, Rue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.27,1:22:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的死换来了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do all those deaths mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.94,1:22:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的死意味着我们的生死由不得自己控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}They mean that our lives were never ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.32,1:22:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们算不上活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was no real life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.53,1:22:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们连选择的余地都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}because we didn't have any choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.57,1:22:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的生死 斯诺说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our lives belong to Snow and our deaths do, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.62,1:22:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 如果你杀了他 凯特尼斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you kill him, Katniss…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.00,1:22:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你终结了这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you end all of this, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.96,1:22:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的朋友就没有白死\N{\fnArial\fs30}all those deaths, they mean something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.22,1:23:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛纳 博格斯 卡斯托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cinna, Boggs, Castor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.39,1:23:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克逊。芬尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jackson, Finnick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.44,1:23:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就死而无憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}They chose this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.69,1:23:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们选择追随你的脚步\N{\fnArial\fs30}They chose you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.20,1:23:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤口要保持干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should keep these clean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.03,1:23:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,防止伤口感染\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise they'll get infected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.08,1:23:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该把我拷起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should cuff me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.63,1:23:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我待在一起不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not safe with me yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.92,1:23:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have moments when I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.13,1:23:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想起了更多的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my memories are getting better, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.34,1:23:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有些时候 我就像在梦游\N{\fnArial\fs30}…other times it's like I'm sleepwalking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.94,1:23:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真该把我拷起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should cuff me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.54,1:24:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.75,1:24:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.76,1:24:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我睡不着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.10,1:24:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我一连好几天都睡不着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I haven't slept in days, either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.40,1:24:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次饥饿游戏的时候 我真该自愿把你换下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've volunteered to take your place in the first Games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.69,1:24:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么要是你那么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you couldn't have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.95,1:24:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那她会永远记恨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she never would have forgiven you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.24,1:24:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,她希望你照顾好她的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She needed you to be there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.70,1:24:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你也的确这么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and take care of her family and you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.95,1:24:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不能失去你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can't lose you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.54,1:24:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真的爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She really loves you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.55,1:24:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看她在世纪争霸赛亲吻你的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the way she kissed you in the Quarter Quell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.13,1:25:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可从来没那么亲过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She never kissed me like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.38,1:25:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道那只是逢场作戏而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, just part of the show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.72,1:25:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是你赢得了她的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, you won her over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.10,1:25:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为她放弃了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gave up everything for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.94,1:25:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是个大问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's not gonna be an issue much longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.24,1:25:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道我们三个人能否一起平安的完成这个任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt all three of us are gonna make it out of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.20,1:25:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是我们都活下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if we do, then…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.49,1:25:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,选谁就由她自己决定 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it's her problem who to choose, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.12,1:25:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.49,1:25:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是呢 我总觉得她谁都选不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do know that Katniss will pick whoever she can't survive without.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.84,1:25:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,机动防爆盾 不是我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mortar shells. It's not ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.46,1:25:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,政府军一定是用它们把起义军挡在城市外头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peacekeepers must be shellin' the rebels outside the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.93,1:25:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,算不上是城市外头\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not outside the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.39,1:25:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sun's comm' up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.94,1:25:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到一些轻武器的枪声\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's some small-arms fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.08,1:25:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是佩勒或者是莱姆的部队攻过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be Paylor, maybe Lyme.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.56,1:25:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,起义军已经逼近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebels are close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.90,1:26:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.16,1:26:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,告知距离市中心半英里之外的市民\N{\fnArial\fs30}To all Capitol citizens more than a half mile outside the City Circle, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.25,1:26:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在要强制疏散\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am announcing a mandatory evacuation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.92,1:26:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,都到我的宅邸这边来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to the mansion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.05,1:26:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你们提供避难所\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am promising you shelter and sanctuary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.80,1:26:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的难民 到我的家里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All refugees, come to my home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.31,1:26:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们提供食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you will be provided with food, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.97,1:26:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,药品 还保证你们孩子的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}medicine, safety for your children, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.10,1:26:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宣誓 誓死\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you will have my solemn oath{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.90,1:26:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,保证保护你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}to protect you until my dying breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.23,1:26:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们应该快点赶上这末班车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wish he'd hurry up with that last part.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.03,1:26:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的敌人可一点都不如我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our enemy is not like us. They do not share our values.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.53,1:26:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们提供不了我们的庇护\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have never known our comfort and our sophistication.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.70,1:26:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还鄙视我们提供的庇护 你们千万不要搞错\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they despise us for it. Make no mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.29,1:26:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是来解放我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are not coming to liberate us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.50,1:27:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是来摧毁我们的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are coming to destroy our way of life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.34,1:27:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会埋葬我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are coming to bury us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.59,1:27:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在还在大楼里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he still in the mansion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.93,1:27:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peeta?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.22,1:27:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我认得这房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I recognize the room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.31,1:27:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.06,1:27:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,隔着五个街道\N{\fnArial\fs30}About five blocks away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.90,1:27:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就在这里 不是在主干道上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're right here. Off the Avenues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.03,1:27:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,大楼就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mansion's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.49,1:27:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,岗楼呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the pods?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.16,1:27:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有可能会关掉这边的岗楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll probably deactivate the pods{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.16,1:27:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,以增援受攻击的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}around here for the residents' safety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.37,1:27:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,能行的 我能再靠近一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}That could work. I could get close enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.33,1:27:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一个治安官都会待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every Peacekeeper's gonna be waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.37,1:27:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,随时准备干掉我们几个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next to our faces on every billboard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.75,1:27:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯诺提供给难民的避难所\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snow's offering shelter to all the refugees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.59,1:27:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在北面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head straight north.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.10,1:27:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,难民肯定成千上万\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gonna be thousands of refugees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.31,1:27:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们混进人流里 不要抬头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get into that stream and don't look up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.31,1:27:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只有一次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got one shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.98,1:28:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就让它成功吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's make it count.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.94,1:28:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特尼斯 祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, Katniss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.32,1:28:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.99,1:28:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,波乐克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pollux.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.63,1:28:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,底格里斯 谢谢你为我们所做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tigris, thank you for everything you've done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.55,1:28:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特尼斯 让我跟你一起行动 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss, let me come with you, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.88,1:28:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以作为诱饵吸引他们的注意力 他们知道我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can be a good distraction. They know my face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.93,1:28:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我不想再失去你一次了 - 你和我们待在一起很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I'm not losing you again. - You'll be safer with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.31,1:28:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是政府军搜查这些屋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if Peacekeepers are searching the houses?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.72,1:28:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他被抓住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if he's captured…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.52,1:28:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就给我一个自杀药丸 我不怕死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then give me a nightlock pill, okay? I'm not goin' back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.72,1:29:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我好好活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.10,1:29:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次再见面的时候 就是新的世界了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I see you again, it's gonna be a different world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.28,1:29:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特尼斯 我们出发吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready, Katniss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.12,1:29:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.72,1:29:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,按照斯诺总统的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}By order of President Snow, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.26,1:29:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有难民必须前往总统官邸避难\N{\fnArial\fs30}all residents must proceed to the Presidential Estate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.81,1:30:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,请各位有秩序的向前行进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, continue to move forward in a calm and orderly fashion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.52,1:30:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,到达后会有人发放饮用水 药物和衣物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Additional food, medicine and clothing will be provided upon arrival.{\r}
