Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.57,1:32:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是叛军\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the rebels!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.41,1:32:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛军来袭\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rebels are attacking!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.12,1:32:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别动 - 攻击叛军\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rebels! - Rebels!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.17,1:32:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑 跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run! Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.34,1:32:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama! Mama!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.26,1:32:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,快过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.32,1:33:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.90,1:33:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.95,1:33:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.95,1:34:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持镇定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.83,1:34:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,把您的孩子送到前面来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring your children forward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.00,1:34:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,大门会定期打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gates will open momentarily.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.21,1:34:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会优先接纳儿童\N{\fnArial\fs30}The children will be received first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.13,1:34:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持镇定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.05,1:34:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,把您的孩子送到前面来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring your children forward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.18,1:34:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,大门会定期打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gates will open momentarily.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.27,1:34:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会优先接纳儿童\N{\fnArial\fs30}The children will be received first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.73,1:34:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.06,1:34:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持镇定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.69,1:35:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,把您的孩子送到前面来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring your children forward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.82,1:35:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,大门会定期打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gates will open momentarily.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.95,1:35:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会优先接纳儿童\N{\fnArial\fs30}The children will be received first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.38,1:35:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是都城的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's The Capitol!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.30,1:35:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,都城的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gifts from The Capitol!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.93,1:35:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gifts!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.27,1:36:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medic!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.15,1:36:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medic!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.11,1:36:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里有伤员 - 快来破拆大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Medic! - Make a hole!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.95,1:36:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medics coming in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.66,1:36:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿个担架来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring a stretcher!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.83,1:36:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边 这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, this way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.54,1:36:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,普瑞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prim?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.58,1:36:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,普瑞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Primrose!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.46,1:36:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,普瑞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prim!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.08,1:37:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我要你躺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. I need you to lie back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.75,1:37:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事 一切都会好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're okay. Everything's gonna be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.72,1:37:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,都城军的飞机在官邸门口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight was over after The Capitol{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.72,1:37:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,投下炸弹后战斗就结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}dropped those bombs to defend the palace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.85,1:37:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,起义军直接攻进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rebels walked right in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.40,1:37:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特尼斯 别乱动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't, Katniss. The ointment's working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.94,1:37:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都感受到了炸弹的冲击力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody felt it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.86,1:37:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些政府军 宫殿守卫的孩子也在人群中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peacekeepers, palace guards. They had kids in there, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.87,1:38:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,都被炸死\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.71,1:38:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,没几个人幸存下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was over after that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.72,1:38:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.36,1:38:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还记得我第一次带你来这的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember the first time I brought you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.91,1:38:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们当时来过这\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.04,1:38:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把你的随身物品都带来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought all your things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.80,1:38:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你先收拾一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll leave you to get settled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.26,1:40:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,您好女士 我不能让您进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, ma'am. Can't let you pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.56,1:40:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.43,1:40:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我授权的\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my authority.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.64,1:40:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有进去查看的资格\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has a right to anything behind that door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.96,1:40:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那朵白玫瑰不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a nice one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.88,1:41:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,多么纯洁的白色啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The colors are lovely, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.97,1:41:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而某些人暗中的勾当要比这花肮脏的多\N{\fnArial\fs30}But nothing says perfection like white.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.18,1:41:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你会来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was hoping you'd find your way here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.06,1:41:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有很多事情想与你探讨一番\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are so many things we should discuss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.07,1:41:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我有预感我们这次的见面时间不会太长\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have a feeling your visit will be brief, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.78,1:41:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 先说重要的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}so first things first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.75,1:41:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先我对你妹妹的去世感到十分遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to tell you how very sorry I am about your sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.92,1:41:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的死本来是可以避免的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So wasteful. So unnecessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.88,1:41:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,明眼人都知道那时大局已定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone could see the game was over by that point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.10,1:41:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 在他们扔下那些炸弹时\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, I was just about to issue an official surrender{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.18,1:41:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正准备签署官方投降令\N{\fnArial\fs30}when they released those parachutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.14,1:41:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,明明是都城军扔下了这些炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You released those parachutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.69,1:41:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的觉得我会下这样的命令？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think I gave the order?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.19,1:41:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都清楚我一定不会伤害儿童\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both know I'm not above killing children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.03,1:42:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会毫无目的的杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not wasteful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.74,1:42:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的杀戮都是有特殊目的的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take life for specific reasons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.20,1:42:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,试问我为什么要杀掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there was no reason for me to destroy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.24,1:42:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多都城的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}a pen full of Capitol children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.33,1:42:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全没有这么做的必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}None at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.96,1:42:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不得不承认科因的这步棋真是高明\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must concede, it was a masterful move on Coin's part.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.22,1:42:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,她让大家认为我轰炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The idea that I was bombing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.84,1:42:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些无助的儿童只是为了抵挡住叛军的脚步\N{\fnArial\fs30}our own helpless children to hold back the rebels…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.14,1:42:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的卫兵因此倒戈相向\N{\fnArial\fs30}It turned the last of my guards against me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.06,1:42:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们一枪没放\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was no resistance left{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.73,1:42:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就攻占了都城和我的宅邸\N{\fnArial\fs30}inside The Capitol or the mansion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.15,1:42:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道不知道战斗的过程是全程直播的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know it aired live?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.61,1:42:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个方法真是十分巧妙啊 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a particular savvy in that, isn't there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.70,1:42:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道她不是故意夺去你妹妹的生命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure she wasn't gunning for your sister, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.08,1:42:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这些事的的确确的发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…these things happen in war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.17,1:43:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的失误在于没能早点猜到科因的意图\N{\fnArial\fs30}My failure was in being so slow to grasp Coin's plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.30,1:43:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她让都城和其它区自相残杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}She let The Capitol and the Districts destroy one another, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.01,1:43:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后她登台掌控大权 我终于明白了她的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}then she stepped in to take power with 13's arsenal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.73,1:43:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我没想错的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, make no mistake, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.27,1:43:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她现在想替代我 当上总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}she intends to take my place now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.27,1:43:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我一直以来注意力都集中在你身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've been watching you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.65,1:43:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也只想一心杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you watching me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.20,1:43:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕我们都上当了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid we've both been played for fools.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.71,1:43:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.33,1:43:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢我亲爱的艾佛丁小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my dear Miss Everdeen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.46,1:43:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们以前承诺过绝不对对方说谎吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we'd agreed never to lie to each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.69,1:44:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,科因总统想见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}President Coin asked for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.24,1:44:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么这么久才来看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never came to see me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.82,1:44:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本想早点来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.45,1:44:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那飞机是起义军的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it ours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.91,1:44:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们扔下的炸弹吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bomb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.83,1:44:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,延时的爆炸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The delayed explosion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.46,1:44:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The trap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.09,1:44:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,延时爆炸是为了让更多的人掉进这个陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}To draw more people in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.01,1:44:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是起义军安排好的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.81,1:44:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.27,1:44:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.06,1:44:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本应该照顾好你的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that I was supposed to take care of your family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.44,1:44:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我没能办到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm sorry I couldn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.83,1:44:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在竞技场里你谁都保护不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't protect anyone in an arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.18,1:45:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔 你走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, Gale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.20,1:45:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.49,1:45:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是幸存下来的胜利者。来一起开个会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The remaining Victors. Won't you join us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.34,1:45:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,邀请你们来这开会有几个目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have invited you all here for several reasons, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.84,1:45:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 我宣布\N{\fnArial\fs30}but first, I have an announcement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.13,1:45:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我光荣的成为了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have taken the burden and the honor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.39,1:45:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,施惠国国的临时总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}of declaring myself Interim President of Panem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.14,1:46:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,临时的？这个临时的时间段大概有多长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interim? Exactly how long is that interim?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.73,1:46:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个恐怕不太好说\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no way of knowing for certain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.53,1:46:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家也都知道现在社会还比较动荡\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's clear that people are far too emotional right now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.61,1:46:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,民众难以做出理性的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}to make a rational decision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.95,1:46:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时机成熟了我们会举行选举的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll plan an election when the time is right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.53,1:46:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫你们来是因为有一个更重要的事情需要决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have called you here for a far more important vote.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.71,1:46:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会进行象征性的投票表决\N{\fnArial\fs30}A symbolic vote.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.08,1:46:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天下午我们将处决斯诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}This afternoon, we will execute Snow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.09,1:46:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他的百余名同党\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hundreds of his accomplices also await their deaths.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.76,1:46:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括一些都城的官员 守卫 政府军士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capitol officials, Peacekeepers, torturers, Gamemakers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.85,1:46:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但问题来了 一旦我们开了这个头\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the danger is, once we begin, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.97,1:46:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,起义军复仇的欲望就会一发不可收拾\N{\fnArial\fs30}the rebels will not stop calling for retribution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.18,1:46:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,民众会变得嗜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirst for blood is a difficult urge to satisfy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.52,1:46:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我这提供一个备选项\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I offer an alternative plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.74,1:46:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,四人同意即通过该提议 不能弃权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majority of four may approve it. No one may abstain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.86,1:46:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的提议如下\N{\fnArial\fs30}The proposal is this:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.28,1:47:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以象征性的举办一个饥饿游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}In lieu of these barbaric executions, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.83,1:47:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,来代替野蛮的行刑过程\N{\fnArial\fs30}we hold a symbolic Hunger Games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.22,1:47:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又想逼迫都城的孩子进行一场饥饿游戏？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna have another Hunger Games with The Capitol's children?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.10,1:47:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在逗我吗？- 我是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're joking? - Not in the slightest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.69,1:47:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是普鲁塔克的点子吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this Plutarch's idea?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.86,1:47:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.53,1:47:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这既满足了公众复仇的欲望\N{\fnArial\fs30}It balances the need for revenge{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.82,1:47:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,也减少死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the least loss of human life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.95,1:47:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们可以开始投票了 - 我反对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You may cast your votes. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.00,1:47:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我坚决反对 这个想法太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, obviously not. This is crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.08,1:47:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我觉得这样挺公平 斯诺自己有个孙女\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's more than fair. Snow's got a granddaughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.54,1:47:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我投赞成票\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say "yes"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.96,1:47:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也赞成 让他们也尝尝痛苦的滋味\N{\fnArial\fs30}So do I. Let them have a taste of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.63,1:47:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要知道 正是我们这种复仇的想法引发了这场起义\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys, this way of thinking is what started these uprisings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.84,1:47:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和皮塔一样 投反对票\N{\fnArial\fs30}I vote "no." With Peeta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.47,1:48:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果芬尼克还活着 他也会反对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So would Finnick, if he were here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.89,1:48:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他会赞成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.22,1:48:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 因为斯诺杀了他 - 我反对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Because Snow killed him. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.48,1:48:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不应该将他们再视作敌人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to stop viewing each other as enemies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.90,1:48:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就看凯特尼斯和黑密契了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's down to Katniss and Haymitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.03,1:48:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要亲手杀了斯诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get to kill Snow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.03,1:48:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会拦着你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I expected no less of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.29,1:48:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我投赞成票\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I vote "yes."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.84,1:48:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了普瑞姆报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Prim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.17,1:48:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑密契\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haymitch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.94,1:48:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和嘲笑鸟一样 投赞成票\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with the Mockingjay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.44,1:48:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,提议通过\N{\fnArial\fs30}That carries the vote.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.98,1:48:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.65,1:49:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,行刑结束后 我会宣布这项提案\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll announce the Games tonight, after the execution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.99,1:49:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就打扮好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's bound to be quite the show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.04,1:49:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 你看起来真是可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you look lovely as ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.13,1:49:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是美丽极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.88,1:49:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扮好啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finishing touches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.34,1:50:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到崭新的施惠国国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the new Panem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.06,1:50:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我们站在贡品大道上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, on the Avenue of the Tributes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:55.06,1:50:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有自由的施惠国们\N{\fnArial\fs30}all of Panem, a free Panem, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.57,1:51:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,都将目睹这一幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}will watch more than a mere spectacle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.11,1:51:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将见证一个伸张正义的历史时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are gathered to witness an historic moment of justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.79,1:51:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天 在这场革命中我们最重要的伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, the greatest friend to the revolution{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.33,1:51:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,将射出那一箭 它将结束所有战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}will fire the shot to end all wars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.80,1:51:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿她的力量象征着暴君专政的终结\N{\fnArial\fs30}May her arrow signify the end of tyranny{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.72,1:51:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,象征着一个新纪元的开端\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the beginning of a new era.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.35,1:51:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘲笑鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mockingjay, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.02,1:51:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿你心灵纯净\N{\fnArial\fs30}may your aim be as true{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:38.35,1:51:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,目光坚定\N{\fnArial\fs30}as your heart is pure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.24,1:52:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.03,1:52:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.37,1:52:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.00,1:52:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他 杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him! Kill him now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.92,1:52:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.25,1:54:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特尼斯 我这么跟你说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll say this for you, Katniss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:02.46,1:54:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没让我失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't disappoint.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.54,1:54:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,普鲁塔克让我带一封信给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Plutarch gave me a letter for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:10.13,1:54:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:11.67,1:54:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 你能不能正常一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never make it easy, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:15.47,1:54:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我来读给您老听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I'll read it for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.35,1:54:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特尼斯 可能所有的施惠国都为你这一箭感到震惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Katniss, maybe the country was shocked tonight by your arrow, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.40,1:54:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但话说回来 也没那么令人惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}but once again, I was not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.27,1:54:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就预料到你会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were exactly who I believed you were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.11,1:54:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望能当面向你道个别\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could give you a proper goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:32.11,1:54:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在科因和斯诺都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But with both Coin and Snow dead, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.86,1:54:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚我们将开会决定这个国家未来的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}the fate of the country will be decided tonight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:36.07,1:54:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没法抽空去见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I can't be seen at your side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.91,1:54:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,12个区的领导人将举行一个自由的选举\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight, the 12 District leaders will call for a free election.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.29,1:54:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,毋庸置疑 佩勒会当上总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's little doubt that Paylor will carry it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.37,1:54:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是一个有理性的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's become the voice of reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.25,1:54:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉你又要身担重负\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry so much burden fell on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:51.13,1:54:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道你会直面这些困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you'll never escape it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.43,1:54:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了这个国家的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if I had to put you through it again{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:55.97,1:54:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉我要暂时将你保护起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}for this outcome, I would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.68,1:55:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争已经结束了 我们现在处在一个相对稳定的阶段\N{\fnArial\fs30}The war's over. We'll enter that sweet period{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.27,1:55:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用再像以前一样担惊受怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}where everyone agrees not to repeat the recent horrors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:08.69,1:55:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我们人类总是反复无常 愚蠢至极\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, we're fickle, stupid beings, with poor memories{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.40,1:55:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是忘记过去 经常自相残杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a great gift for self-destruction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:16.66,1:55:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许经过这场战争 我们才能学会许多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although, who knows? Maybe this time, we'll learn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:21.41,1:55:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,送你出都城时我会亲自保证你的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've secured you a ride out of The Capitol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.29,1:55:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你最好远离公众视野\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's better for you to be out of sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.21,1:55:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,时机成熟时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when the time is right, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.42,1:55:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩勒指挥官会赦免你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander Paylor will pardon you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:30.38,1:55:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个国家终于获得了和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}The country will find its peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:32.71,1:55:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你的心境也能平和下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you can find yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.42,1:55:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,普鲁塔克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plutarch…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.93,1:55:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}What now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.31,1:55:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:45.23,1:55:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:52.36,1:55:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得好好和你道个别才能放你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't let you go without a proper goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.12,1:56:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特尼斯 你要好好照顾自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your job to take care of yourself now, Katniss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:07.37,1:56:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,向我保证你会找到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise me you'll find it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:10.50,1:56:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:13.38,1:56:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,属于胜利者的生活方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}The life of a Victor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:17.68,1:56:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 - 再见 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Goodbye, Effie. - Goodbye, my girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:24.52,1:56:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,别把自己变成一个陌生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Effie, don't be a stranger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:31.36,1:56:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 照顾好她 - 我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take care of her. - I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:05.49,1:58:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.75,1:58:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.34,1:58:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚出去 普瑞姆死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out! Prim is gone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:21.97,1:58:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,普瑞姆死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prim is gone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:24.09,1:58:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她死了 永远都不会回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dead! And she's not coming back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:26.72,1:58:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out! Get out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.03,2:00:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peeta?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:08.32,2:00:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:11.24,2:00:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:13.99,2:00:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.34,2:00:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我从森林边摘的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found these, uh, out by the edge of the forest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:28.63,2:00:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,报春花\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a primrose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.52,2:00:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}So sorry, Katniss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:53.49,2:00:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些好消息告诉你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You'll be happy to hear that Katniss' mother{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:55.83,2:00:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特妮斯的母亲正在都城培训新医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}has been training new medical units in The Capitol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:58.37,2:01:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔被提拔为二区的区长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gale has been promoted to a captain in District 2{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:00.96,2:01:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,维护二区的秩序和安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}to help keep order and security.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:03.38,2:01:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我享受与我的儿子在一起的每分每秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am loving every moment with my son{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:05.67,2:01:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到他总是让我想起他的爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}who reminds me every day of his father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:08.38,2:01:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都承受了太多苦难\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've all suffered so much, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:10.26,2:01:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过为了我们的回忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we owe it to their memories and to our children{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:13.26,2:01:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我们的子孙 我们要活得更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}to do our best with these lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:15.89,2:01:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望大家都能过上平静的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you're both finding some peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:18.98,2:01:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Annie…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:29.95,2:01:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我庄严宣誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I solemnly swear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:31.45,2:01:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽我最大的力 来捍卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the best of my ability, to preserve, protect, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:35.66,2:01:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个施惠国公民的权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}and uphold the rights of every citizen of Panem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:39.29,2:01:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是普鲁塔克写的演讲稿吧 这风格我太熟悉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's Plutarch, right in the middle of it all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:42.62,2:01:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那句话是怎么说来着：「政治舞台真是瞬息万变啊」\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they say no one ever wins the Games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:04.66,2:03:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You love me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:08.00,2:03:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real or not real?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:12.13,2:03:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:09.27,2:04:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做噩梦了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you have a nightmare?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:12.82,2:04:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也会做噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have nightmares, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:21.28,2:04:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天 我会向你解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someday I'll explain it to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:24.74,2:04:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么它们会出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why they came, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:27.79,2:04:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么它们永远挥之不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}why they won't ever go away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:37.47,2:04:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我也会告诉你 我如何克服它\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'll tell you how I survive it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:41.47,2:04:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会在脑子里列一张\N{\fnArial\fs30}I make a list in my head{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:44.18,2:04:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人做过好事的清单\N{\fnArial\fs30}of all the good things I've seen someone do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:48.52,2:04:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使它们微不足道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every little thing I can remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:54.27,2:04:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就像一个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:56.53,2:04:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一遍遍地玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do it over and over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:01.32,2:05:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,以至于这些年有点乏味了 但\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gets a little tedious after all these years, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:06.41,2:05:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,生活是场更艰难的游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}…there are much worse games to play.{\r}
